WEBVTT

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:03.440
a cold, foreign, hostile place.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.296
On the first day of my recruiting visit,

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.456
I texted my sister
an excuse for not going.

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:10.240
"These people are so weird."

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:14.096
She replied, "You'll fit right in."

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:17.000
(Laughter)

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.896
I took the ticket

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.096
and worked damn hard to fit right in.

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:26.416
When my freshman advisor warned me
not to wear my fitted hats on campus ...

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:30.160
"You're at Yale now. You don't have to
do that anymore," she said.